sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Python client
    participant Bridge as FastAPI bridge
    participant FS as Shared filesystem
    participant Worker as MATLAB service
    participant Logic as processRequest

    Client->>Bridge: HTTP POST
    Bridge->>FS: write request.json
    Worker->>FS: poll input folder
    Worker->>Logic: decode JSON, dispatch action
    Logic->>Logic: compute / filter / plan
    Logic->>Worker: result struct
    Worker->>FS: write request.out.json
    Bridge->>FS: read response
    Bridge->>Client: typed HTTP response

    Note over FS: $SOC_PATH/runtime/exchange/service_name/input/
    Note over Worker: JsonFileIpc.processLoop
